-ends at a line reading ``$(echo E)``, and ``` <<`echo E` ```, ``<<$((1+2))`` and ``<<${x:-a b}``
-likewise, spaces and all. ``$'…'`` and ``$"…"`` are quoting: ``<<$'\\x45'`` ends at ``E``.
